<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/delphi10000-dactylioceras-commune-turing-wavelength-s0-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Lineage mode count at fixed 24 µm" ;
    dct:description "States what changes at 181 Ma versus the 240 Ma predecessor and the 75 Ma successor when the detail wavelength is held at 24 µm | Variables: 3484 µm Whitby rib, 1088 µm Ceratites organ wavelength, 2530 µm Placenticeras organ wavelength" ;
